            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3] Website and documentation need incubator disclaimer</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Per the &lt;a href=&quot;https://incubator.apache.org/guides/branding.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Incubator branding guidelines&lt;/a&gt;, the website needs a disclaimer added to the front page and the source tree needs the DISCLAIMER file add to its root level.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
