&lt;p&gt;In &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3&quot; title=&quot;Website and documentation need incubator disclaimer&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-3&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-3&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;-source.patch &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;i think &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;Apache Calcite is an effort undergoing ....
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;should be changed to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;Apache Zeppelin is an effort undergoing ...
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Could you recreate patch?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14380613" author="jghoman" created="Wed, 25 Mar 2015 19:46:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Good catch. Updated patch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14381190" author="moon" created="Thu, 26 Mar 2015 01:34:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks. It looks good.&lt;br/&gt;
If there&apos;re no other objects, I&apos;m merging it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14381785" author="moon" created="Thu, 26 Mar 2015 12:20:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I successfully applied &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3&quot; title=&quot;Website and documentation need incubator disclaimer&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-3&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-3&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;-source-2.patch.&lt;br/&gt;
but &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3&quot; title=&quot;Website and documentation need incubator disclaimer&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-3&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-3&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;-website.patch seems not okay.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;moon$ git am &amp;lt; ZEPPELIN-3-website.patch 
Applying: ZEPPELIN-3: Adding disclaimer to website.
error: patch failed: index.md:99
error: index.md: patch does not apply
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Could you check if &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3&quot; title=&quot;Website and documentation need incubator disclaimer&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-3&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-3&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;-website.patch works for you?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14382696" author="jghoman" created="Thu, 26 Mar 2015 21:20:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;hmmm, looks like some problem between the branch I used for generating the patch (which was obliterated with the recent github import) and the new gh-pages branch that&apos;s replaced it.  I&apos;ve regenerated the patch and verified it applies.  Jekyll isn&apos;t working for me (it rarely does... grumble grumble ruby), so I wasn&apos;t able to verify the output.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14383275" author="moon" created="Fri, 27 Mar 2015 03:14:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;both patch merged. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
